insert into public.page_sections (page,key,label,data,sort,visible) values ('home','hero','Hero','{"pill":"Marketing and Software Solutions","heading":"Our Tailored Services","text":"From strategy and data to cloud, security and daily operations, we put together the right mix of services to help your business grow.","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80","imageAlt":"Professional thinking through a project at her desk","buttonText":"Book Free Consultation","buttonLink":"/contact-us/"}'::jsonb,0,true),('home','intro','Intro statement','{"before":"We bring strategy, data, cloud, security and day to day business support together, so growing companies get","highlight":"one dependable partner","after":"instead of a long list of vendors.","linkText":"More about AchiveX","linkTo":"/about-us/"}'::jsonb,1,true),('home','explorer','What we do (service explorer)','{"title":"What we do","text":"Seven service areas, one team. Pick one area or combine several."}'::jsonb,2,true),('home','why','Why AchiveX','{"title":"Why AchiveX","text":"A practical partner that explains every step and focuses on work that makes a real difference.","items":[{"title":"Your business comes first","text":"Every engagement starts with how your company works today. Recommendations follow from that, not from a product list."},{"title":"One partner, fewer handoffs","text":"Strategy, data, cloud, security and process support sit under one roof, so nothing falls between vendors."},{"title":"Plain language, honest estimates","text":"Scope, cost and risk are written so your whole leadership team can follow them."},{"title":"Built to hand over","text":"We document what we build and train your people, so you are never locked in."}]}'::jsonb,3,true),('home','spotlights','Service spotlights','{"items":[{"title":"Data and AI, used carefully","text":"Clean, well governed data comes first. From there we build reporting people trust and apply generative AI only where it saves real time.","points":["Data platforms that replace manual spreadsheets","Dashboards built around real decisions","Generative AI pilots with clear success measures"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526628953301-3e589a6a8b74?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80","alt":"Screens showing data dashboards","to":"/services/data-and-analytics/","link":"Explore Data and Analytics"},{"title":"Cloud you can run with confidence","text":"We plan migrations workload by workload, test every cutover and keep the environment healthy once it is live.","points":["Migration plans with tested rollback","Monitoring, backups and patching","Cost reviews that keep bills predictable"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80","alt":"Server room with network cabling","to":"/services/cloud/","link":"Explore Cloud"}]}'::jsonb,4,true),('home','process','How we work','{"title":"How we work","text":"The same four steps on every engagement, whatever its size.","steps":[{"title":"Consult","text":"A free conversation about your goals, constraints and current setup."},{"title":"Plan","text":"A written proposal with scope, timeline, team and cost."},{"title":"Deliver","text":"Short cycles with regular demos and progress updates."},{"title":"Support","text":"Handover, training and optional ongoing support."}]}'::jsonb,5,true),('home','industries','Industries','{"title":"Industries we serve","text":"Each sector has its own rules and pressures. We adapt our services to fit them."}'::jsonb,6,true),('home','platforms','Platforms','{"title":"Platforms we work with","note":"Product names are trademarks of their owners."}'::jsonb,7,true),('home','featured_case','Featured case study','{"caseSlug":"retail-storefront-rebuild"}'::jsonb,8,true),('home','insights','Latest insights','{"title":"Latest insights","text":"Case studies, practical articles and guides from our team."}'::jsonb,9,true),('home','faq','Common questions','{"title":"Common questions","text":"Do not see your question here? Call or email us and we will answer it directly.","items":[{"q":"What size of business do you work with?","a":"We work with small and mid sized companies as well as larger teams that need extra capacity. The scope of each engagement is set to fit your size and budget."},{"q":"Can we start with one service and add more later?","a":"Yes. Many clients start with a single need, such as a cloud migration or contact center support, and add other services as they grow."},{"q":"Do you work with clients outside Wyoming?","a":"Yes. Our headquarters is in Wyoming, USA, and engagements can be delivered remotely. Contact us to discuss your location and needs."},{"q":"How does the free consultation work?","a":"It is a conversation with our team about your goals and current setup. There is no obligation, and if we are not the right fit we will tell you."},{"q":"Who owns the work you deliver?","a":"Ownership terms are set in each client agreement. In most cases code, accounts and documentation are held in your name."}]}'::jsonb,10,true),('home','contact_strip','Contact strip','{}'::jsonb,11,true),('home','cta','Call to action','{"title":"Have a project in mind?","text":"Book a free consultation and we will talk through your goals, your current setup and where we can help.","button":"Book a Free Consultation"}'::jsonb,12,true) on conflict (page,key) do nothing;
insert into public.site_settings (key,value) values ('general','{"siteName":"AchiveX LLC","tagline":"Empowering Businesses Through Digital Innovation.","phone":"+1 307 622 1140","email":"info@achivex.com","location":"Wyoming, USA","googleProfile":"https://share.google/KfuKHdFVYJpytpi3L"}'::jsonb),('social','{"facebook":"https://www.facebook.com/achivexllc","x":"https://x.com/achivexllc","linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/achivexllc/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/achivexllc"}'::jsonb),('seo','{"titleTemplate":"%title% | AchiveX LLC","homeTitle":"AchiveX LLC | Empowering Businesses Through Digital Innovation","defaultDescription":"AchiveX LLC is a Wyoming based marketing and software solutions company offering digital, data, cloud, security and business process services.","ogImage":"","twitterHandle":"@achivexllc","googleVerification":"","bingVerification":""}'::jsonb),('schema','{"type":"Organization","name":"AchiveX LLC","url":"https://www.achivex.com","logo":"","phone":"+1 307 622 1140","email":"info@achivex.com","region":"WY","country":"US"}'::jsonb),('robots','{"content":"User-agent: *\nAllow: /\n\nSitemap: https://www.achivex.com/sitemap.xml"}'::jsonb) on conflict (key) do nothing;
